  "meta": {
    "project": "memory-test",
    "chapter": "history-test.mjs + history-test2.mjs 章节 → LangChain ChatMessageHistory（内存版 / 文件系统版）单会话记忆",
    "schema_version": 1,
    "generated_by": "manual",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-03",
    "description": "本图谱以 history-test.mjs（两轮多轮对话：手动管理 SystemMessage + HumanMessage + AIMessage 历史，存于内存数组）+ history-test2.mjs（同上但用 FileSystemChatMessageHistory 持久化到 JSON 文件，支持 sessionId 多会话）为锚点，覆盖 LangChain InMemoryChatMessageHistory 与 FileSystemChatMessageHistory 的核心概念、消息类型、对话轮次处理、上下文传递机制、持久化与多会话（sessionId）以及设计模式（手动管理 vs RunnableWithMessageHistory 自动管理）。节点总数 41（step: 13 / concept: 22 / param: 6），边总数 64。后续新增 src/*.mjs 时只需在本 JSON 中加节点/边，并在 graph.md 中同步。"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "concept.chat_history",
      "label": "ChatMessageHistory 对话历史",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "LangChain 中抽象的“会话级消息存储”接口（BaseChatMessageHistory），规定了一组方法：addMessage / getMessages / clear 等。所有具体实现（内存版 / Redis 版 / SQLite 版 / Postgres 版 / Upstash 版）都遵循同一接口，业务代码可在不感知底层存储的前提下切换。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "16",
      "api": "interface BaseChatMessageHistory { addMessage(msg); getMessages(); clear(); }"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.in_memory_history",
      "label": "InMemoryChatMessageHistory 内存实现",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "BaseChatMessageHistory 的最简实现：消息存放在进程内的数组里。优点是零依赖、零延迟、适合单进程 demo 与单元测试；缺点是进程重启即丢失、无法跨进程共享、不能横向扩展。本项目 src/history-test.mjs 用的就是这个实现。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "16",
      "api": "new InMemoryChatMessageHistory()"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.filesystem_history",
      "label": "FileSystemChatMessageHistory 文件系统实现",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "BaseChatMessageHistory 的磁盘持久化实现：把消息以 JSON 序列化方式追加到一个本地文件中。底层位于 @langchain/community/stores/message/file_system。优点是进程重启后历史仍在、能跨进程共享同一个 JSON 文件、零额外依赖；缺点是单文件 I/O 不适合高并发写入、磁盘文件会无限增长、跨机器需要共享文件系统。典型用法：new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath, sessionId })，同一个 sessionId 多次 new 实例时能读到上次写入的消息。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "3, 18, 27-30",
      "api": "new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath: 'chat_history.json', sessionId: 'user_001' })"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.session_id",
      "label": "sessionId 会话标识",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "会话的唯一标识，作为持久化 history 的“分区键”。FileSystemChatMessageHistory 内部用 sessionId 把不同会话的消息写到一个共享 JSON 文件的不同数组里；同 sessionId 的多个实例能读到同一段历史。history-test2.mjs 固定使用 'user_session_001'，实际生产应来自登录态 / cookie / JWT。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "19, 29",
      "api": "const sessionId = 'user_session_001';"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.persistence",
      "label": "持久化 Persistence",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "将消息写入非易失性存储（磁盘 / 数据库 / 远端 KV），使得进程重启后历史仍然可读。FileSystemChatMessageHistory 是“单机磁盘级”持久化；进一步扩展到 Redis / SQLite / Postgres / UpstashRedisChatMessageHistory 可获得跨进程、跨机器、横向扩展能力。持久化 vs 内存版的本质差异：内存版生命周期 ≤ 进程；持久化版生命周期 ≥ 服务（甚至 ∞）。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "27-30, 35, 39, 43, 49, 53, 57",
      "api": "history.addMessage(msg) → 内部 writeFile() / SET redis_key / INSERT INTO ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.multi_session",
      "label": "多会话 Multi-Session",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "一个 history 实例只对应一个会话（一个用户、一个窗口）。要支持多用户/多窗口并存，需要：(a) 每个 sessionId 各自一份 history 实例；(b) 通过工厂函数 (sessionId) => history 做映射；(c) 持久化版本天然支持多 sessionId 写同一文件的不同数组。history-test2.mjs 通过硬编码 sessionId='user_session_001' 演示单 session；下一阶段会演进为工厂模式。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "19",
      "api": "store = {}; getHistory = (sid) => store[sid] ??= new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath, sessionId: sid });"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.base_message",
      "label": "BaseMessage 消息基类",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "LangChain 中所有消息类型的根类，位于 @langchain/core/messages。包含 content（字符串或数组）、type（'human' / 'ai' / 'system' / 'tool' / 'function'）等关键字段；子类有 HumanMessage / AIMessage / SystemMessage / ToolMessage / FunctionMessage / RemoveMessage。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "4, 18-20, 24, 36",
      "api": "class BaseMessage { content, type, name, additional_kwargs }"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.human_message",
      "label": "HumanMessage 用户消息",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "代表用户输入，type='human'。在多轮对话中每轮提问都构造一个 HumanMessage 实例并 addMessage 到 history。本项目两轮对话都先 addMessage(HumanMessage)，再调模型。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "4, 24, 36",
      "api": "new HumanMessage('你今天吃的什么？')"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.ai_message",
      "label": "AIMessage 模型回复",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "代表 LLM 的回复，type='ai'。model.invoke() 直接返回的就是 AIMessage（content + tool_calls 等字段）。把它 addMessage 到 history 后，下一轮对话模型就能“看到”自己上一轮说过的话。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "29, 41",
      "api": "const response = await model.invoke(messages); await history.addMessage(response);"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.system_message",
      "label": "SystemMessage 系统提示",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "代表系统级角色设定，type='system'。不进入 history，而是每轮临时拼到 messages 数组的最前面（[systemMessage, ...history.getMessages()]）。这样保证角色设定“不污染”历史，同时每轮都被模型看到。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "18-20, 27, 39",
      "api": "new SystemMessage('你是一个友好、幽默的做菜助手…')"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.turn",
      "label": "对话轮次 Turn",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "一次完整的“用户问 → 模型答”循环。在 history-test.mjs 中显式编码成 5 步：(1) 构造 HumanMessage → (2) addMessage → (3) 拼 messages=[system, ...history] → (4) model.invoke → (5) addMessage(response)。每轮 history 都比上一轮多 2 条。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "22-32, 34-44",
      "api": "5-step pattern: HumanMessage → addMessage → 拼 messages → invoke → addMessage(response)"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.context_passing",
      "label": "上下文传递机制",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "把历史消息作为 LLM 输入的一部分传过去，让模型“看到”之前的对话。本项目做法：[systemMessage, ...await history.getMessages()]，其中 history.getMessages() 返回当前累积的全部消息。这样第二轮模型就能基于“你今天吃的什么？”的第一轮回答，回答“好吃吗？”。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "27, 39",
      "api": "[systemMessage, ...(await history.getMessages())]"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.llm",
      "label": "LLM 大语言模型",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "生成式语言模型。本项目用 ChatOpenAI（OpenAI 兼容协议，可指向阿里 DashScope / 小米 mimo 等兼容端点）。temperature: 0 让输出更稳定；modelName / apiKey / baseURL 都从环境变量读，遵循 12-factor 配置原则。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "6-13, 28, 40",
      "api": "new ChatOpenAI({ modelName, apiKey, temperature: 0, configuration: { baseURL } })"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.model_invoke",
      "label": "model.invoke 调用",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "LangChain 统一入口：传一个消息数组，返回一个 AIMessage。本项目把 [systemMessage, ...历史] 直接 invoke 进去，模型就拿到完整上下文。invoke 是同步调用；流式输出用 stream，多输入并行用 batch。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "28, 40",
      "api": "const response = await model.invoke(messages);"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.lifecycle",
      "label": "实例生命周期",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "InMemoryChatMessageHistory 实例在内存里只活到进程退出。在多轮对话 demo 中，常见做法是一个用户/会话 = 一个 history 实例；多用户场景需配合 getSessionHistory 等工厂模式做 session_id → history 的映射。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "16",
      "api": "const history = new InMemoryChatMessageHistory();"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.api_methods",
      "label": "核心 API 方法",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "BaseChatMessageHistory 规定三件套：addMessage(msg) 追加；getMessages() 取全量（异步以兼容外部存储）；clear() 清空。本项目只用前两者。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "25, 27, 29, 37, 39, 41, 48",
      "api": "history.addMessage(msg) / await history.getMessages() / history.clear()"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.design_pattern_manual",
      "label": "设计模式：手动管理",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "本项目采用的范式：业务代码显式维护 history，手动 addMessage、拼 messages、invoke、再 addMessage。优点是控制力强、流程透明；缺点是重复代码多、易遗漏 addMessage、易把 systemMessage 错加进 history。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "22-44",
      "api": "显式五步法：construct → addMessage → getMessages → invoke → addMessage(response)"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.design_pattern_auto",
      "label": "设计模式：RunnableWithMessageHistory 自动管理",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "LangChain 提供的“自动记忆”包装：把 Runnable（如 prompt | model）用 RunnableWithMessageHistory 包起来后，每次调用只需传 input；它会按 session_id 自动从 history 读旧消息、追加 input、追加 output。彻底把 5 步法收敛为 1 步，但需要在工厂函数里返回 history。",
      "impl_file": null,
      "impl_lines": null,
      "api": "new RunnableWithMessageHistory({ runnable, getMessageHistory: (sessionId) => history })"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.system_message_strategy",
      "label": "SystemMessage 拼接策略",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "本项目把 SystemMessage 放在每轮 messages 数组最前面，且不写入 history。这避免了 (a) SystemMessage 被算入历史 token 消耗；(b) 后续想换 system 提示时不需要遍历历史逐条清理。如果要“动态人格切换”，应改用 SystemMessage 写入 history 配合 RemoveMessage 的方案。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "27, 39",
      "api": "[systemMessage, ...(await history.getMessages())]"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.window_buffer",
      "label": "窗口缓冲 Window Buffer",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "本项目隐含的策略：把所有历史消息原样塞进 prompt（=窗口无限大）。优点：实现简单、模型能看到所有上下文；缺点：随着对话轮次增多，token 消耗线性增长，最终撞上模型的上下文窗口上限。生产环境通常改用 (a) 截断只保留最近 N 轮；(b) 用 LLM 摘要早期对话；(c) 加 trim_messages 工具。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "27, 39",
      "api": "未截断的 messages 列表"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.token_growth",
      "label": "token 线性增长",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "由于 history 只增不减，每轮 messages 长度 = 1 (system) + 2n (n=轮次)。第 1 轮 = 3 条；第 2 轮 = 5 条；第 N 轮 = 2N+1 条。本项目结束时 history 共 4 条：HumanMessage + AIMessage + HumanMessage + AIMessage。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "48-56",
      "api": "len(messages) = 2N + 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept.comparison_persistent",
      "label": "对比：持久化实现",
      "category": "concept",
      "summary": "生产环境一般不用 InMemoryChatMessageHistory，而用：RedisChatMessageHistory（@langchain/redis）/ SQLiteChatMessageHistory（@langchain/community）/ PostgresChatMessageHistory / UpstashRedisChatMessageHistory。本项目 src/history-test2.mjs 演示最轻量的一种：FileSystemChatMessageHistory（@langchain/community/stores/message/file_system），把消息以 JSON 写到本地文件，零额外依赖。它们都继承 BaseChatMessageHistory 接口，API 完全一致，只需替换 new 语句。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "3, 27-30",
      "api": "new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath, sessionId }) / RedisChatMessageHistory({ sessionId, url }) / SQLiteChatMessageHistory({ sessionId, db })"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.init_model",
      "label": "初始化模型",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "用 ChatOpenAI 构造 LLM 客户端，4 项配置全从 .env 读：MODEL_NAME / OPENAI_API_KEY / OPENAI_BASE_URL / 隐含的 temperature。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "6-13",
      "api": "new ChatOpenAI({ modelName, apiKey, temperature: 0, configuration: { baseURL } })"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.init_history",
      "label": "创建 history 实例",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "new InMemoryChatMessageHistory() 拿到一个进程内的空历史（src/history-test.mjs）。src/history-test2.mjs 用的是 FileSystemChatMessageHistory，构造时必须传 filePath + sessionId 两项，构造完即会从磁盘加载已有消息。多用户场景下通常在工厂函数里按 session_id 创建。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "16",
      "api": "const history = new InMemoryChatMessageHistory(); // 内存版\nconst history = new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath, sessionId }); // 文件版"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.build_system",
      "label": "构造 SystemMessage",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "new SystemMessage('…') 构造一个角色设定对象。该对象不会被写入 history，而是每轮临时拼到 messages 头部。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "18-20",
      "api": "const systemMessage = new SystemMessage('…');"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.add_human",
      "label": "addMessage(HumanMessage)",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "把用户输入写入 history。getMessages() 之后就能看到它。每轮对话的第一步。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "24-25, 36-37",
      "api": "const userMessage = new HumanMessage(text); await history.addMessage(userMessage);"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.compose_messages",
      "label": "拼装 messages 数组",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "把 systemMessage 放最前面，剩余的展开自 history.getMessages()。这是“上下文传递”的具体动作，决定了模型能看到哪些消息。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "27, 39",
      "api": "const messages = [systemMessage, ...(await history.getMessages())];"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.invoke_model",
      "label": "调用 model.invoke",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "把 messages 数组丢给模型，返回一个 AIMessage。这一步是“生成”，没有持久化动作。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "28, 40",
      "api": "const response = await model.invoke(messages);"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.add_ai",
      "label": "addMessage(AIMessage)",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "把模型回复写回 history。这是“记忆”最关键的一步：少了它，下一轮模型就不知道前面说过什么。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "29, 41",
      "api": "await history.addMessage(response);"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.print_round",
      "label": "打印本轮对话",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "在每轮对话末尾 console.log 用户消息和助手回复，便于人眼验证模型是否真的“记住了”上下文。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "31-32, 43-44",
      "api": "console.log(`用户: ${userMessage.content}\\n助手: ${response.content}`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.print_history",
      "label": "打印完整历史",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "在所有轮次结束后遍历 history.getMessages()，打印每条消息的类型和前 50 字摘要。这是“验证 history 是否在累积”的兜底观测点。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "46-56",
      "api": "allMessages.forEach((msg, index) => console.log(...))"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.resolve_filepath",
      "label": "解析文件路径",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "用 path.join(process.cwd(), 'chat_history.json') 拼出绝对路径。FileSystemChatMessageHistory 要求 filePath 是绝对路径或相对进程 cwd 的路径；用 process.cwd() 而不是 __dirname，是因为 ESM 下 __dirname 不可用。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "5, 18",
      "api": "const filePath = path.join(process.cwd(), 'chat_history.json');"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.bind_session",
      "label": "绑定 sessionId",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "用常量 sessionId='user_session_001' 作为本次会话的唯一标识。生产环境应替换为从请求上下文/JWT/cookie 里拿到的真实用户标识。注意：FileSystemChatMessageHistory 的 sessionId 一旦绑定，整个生命周期都只能读/写该 session 的消息；切换用户需要 new 一个新实例。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "19",
      "api": "const sessionId = 'user_session_001';"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.open_history_persistent",
      "label": "创建持久化 history 实例",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath, sessionId })：构造时立即读磁盘文件并解析出属于该 sessionId 的消息数组；如果文件不存在则为空数组。这是与 InMemoryChatMessageHistory 最大的区别——构造后不是空数组，而是磁盘上的当前状态。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "27-30",
      "api": "const history = new FileSystemChatMessageHistory({ filePath, sessionId });"
    },
    {
      "id": "step.print_persist_notice",
      "label": "打印持久化提示",
      "category": "step",
      "summary": "每轮对话结束后 console.log 告知用户消息已写入磁盘文件，是“持久化生效”的可视化验证。注意：history-test.mjs 没这个日志，因为内存版没有可观察的外部副作用。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "43, 57",
      "api": "console.log(`✓ 对话已保存到文件: ${filePath}`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "param.model_name",
      "label": "MODEL_NAME",
      "category": "param",
      "summary": "模型名，本项目 = qwen3.7-max-2026-06-08（阿里 DashScope 兼容端点下的模型）。可通过 .env 切换到 mimo-v2.5-pro 等其他 OpenAI 兼容模型。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "7",
      "api": "process.env.MODEL_NAME"
    },
    {
      "id": "param.openai_api_key",
