      "label": "temperature",
      "category": "param",
      "summary": "采样温度。本项目固定为 0（确定性输出），适合做“是否记住上下文”的对照测试——相同输入应得到相同回复，方便验证 history 真的生效。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "9",
      "api": "temperature: 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "param.filepath",
      "label": "FILE_PATH",
      "category": "param",
      "summary": "FileSystemChatMessageHistory 的存储文件路径。history-test2.mjs = path.join(process.cwd(), 'chat_history.json')。文件结构是 JSON，顶层有 sessions 字段，每个 sessionId 对应一个消息数组。生产环境建议改成 path.join(process.cwd(), 'data', 'chat_history.json')，并把 data/ 加进 .gitignore。",
      "impl_file": "src/history-test2.mjs",
      "impl_lines": "18",
      "api": "path.join(process.cwd(), 'chat_history.json')"
    },
    {
